cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or benchmark, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "A Leakage-Controlled Cold-Start Benchmark for Drug-Combination Synergy Classification"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible benchmark asking how much drug-combination synergy is predictable from
  pre-treatment identity and context alone, with all response-derived variables excluded,
  evaluated under standard, leave-drug-out, leave-cell-line-out, leave-tissue-out and
  leave-study-out regimes on DrugComb v1.5.
type: software
authors:
